{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_12_level_main_12-14_beg","groupId":"main_12","stageId":"main_12-14","title":"天邊的火燒雲","storyCode":"12-16","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_12-14_beg.txt","sourceHash":"ad0083114d5f21f8ddf46f7f4217d20fa1a7515b2b3863d331c3f1e1c4276567","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g7_airshipdock"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是......飛空艇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們所有的潛入計劃都失敗了，靠近的人就像憑空消失了一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是某種薩卡茲巫術嗎，魔王？你應當知道該如何破解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭小姐......她也在這裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我感受不到——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一股沉重的壓力襲來。\n它無法被描述，它無法被言說，那麼濃重，那麼殘酷。\n阿米婭幾乎無法站穩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在做什麼，魔王？別想搞什麼小動作！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"使用你的那些巫術，幫我們破解它！否則的話——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你來了，阿斯卡綸。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我來晚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿斯卡綸，別激動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位同事的行為與我無關！我勸過他，可他不願意聽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我無意傷害你們的博士，我們只是在完成交易，那時候你也是見證人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就滾開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"怎麼了？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"你的表情很難看。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你感受不到，你不是薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......在面對自己的歷史。在面對薩卡茲千萬年的苦難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它在訴說，它在憤怒，它強迫我們每個人聆聽它的悲號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怪不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，大公爵們要失望了，這並非什麼可被複製的工業技術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這艘船，是一位死魂靈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......這些聲音......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，別被它影響！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"堅持住，這只是幻象！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白，我在嘗試......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚——啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的影子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，這不是和那位伊內絲小姐類似的操縱陰影的源石技藝，這是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，離開飛空艇的影子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"飛空艇的陰影蠕動著，延展著，被阿斯卡綸擊倒在地的另一名“灰禮帽”瞬間淹沒在漆黑的海洋中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"開什麼玩笑，這到底是什麼......"},{"type":"narration","text":"深重的黑色，深重的絕望，深重的憤怒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_i10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"死魂靈......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別去看，阿米婭，那是死魂靈的巫術！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到了淚水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死魂靈，我看到了如此沉重的悲傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您一直與這些悲傷在一起嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您用憤怒的火焰灼燒傷口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......很痛苦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g7_airshipdock"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿斯卡綸踉蹌了幾步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你沒事吧，阿斯卡綸？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......還好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭她——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"死魂靈巨大的陰影裡，阿米婭仍然昂著頭。\n在這個角度，看不到阿米婭的表情，唯一能知道的是，她仍昂著頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您說得對，死魂靈。我應該去看，我看見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看見了這一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看見了那三千四百二十一次毀滅，我看見了每一片磚瓦化為灰燼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看見了每一位魔王的反抗，我看見了他們每一個人的心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到了那些被吞嚥的淚水和鮮血，我看到了那些被高揚起的塵土和碎片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如此相似的身影交疊著倒下，如此相似的場景反覆上演。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到了，我仍然選擇去看，我還會繼續看下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死魂靈，我沒有一刻移開目光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會牢牢記住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會記住每一次艱難的選擇，每一次的死亡與犧牲，每一次的毀滅，每一次的希望。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我已經在努力——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我一定不會——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭小姐希望我能成為......！她說，就算是異族，我們依然會感同身受！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米婭突然發現自己無法說出一個字。\n她為什麼要阻止這場戰爭？\n在看了這些憤恨，這些痛苦，這些渴求之後。\n她為什麼要阻止這場戰爭？\n這......這場戰爭，對於薩卡茲而言，確實是唯一的方法。\n每一個薩卡茲，在面對了這一切之後，都無法得出其他答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米婭發現了，有一瞬間，她理解了特蕾西婭現在的選擇。\n用淚水湮沒淚水，用苦難填埋苦難。\n只有焚毀的土地才能給薩卡茲帶來新生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我仍拒絕這條路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"所以，死魂靈說的是對的。\n正因為她拒絕，所以她永遠無法真正與他們站在一起。\n她可以抽身而出。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"陰影狂亂地抖動分裂著，簡直要化為實體。\n死魂靈混亂的投影正在這座空曠的船塢中析出。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是個大傢伙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"紫色的火焰撞上了黑色的陰影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我對你們的存在很感興趣，死魂靈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若是你被灼燒，會留下什麼樣子的餘火呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那條德拉克......愛布拉娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"任務簡報裡可沒說過她會親自出現在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走！快走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我沒事......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"來，我扶著你。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我確實沒辦法，真正和他們站在一起......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"也許，正因為這樣，才必須是你。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那條德拉克的火燒過來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她......很強大。我們沒必要在這裡對抗她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼——有意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我最近，是不是經常聽到這個名字？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g9_airshipdockcorridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭軍士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將......將軍，那條德拉克......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用理會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的那些火焰，除了自己狹隘的野心，什麼都點不燃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死魂靈閣下，請您帶領我們離開這裡。這狹小的船塢容納不下您的憤怒，這些聒噪的異族也不值得浪費您的時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我收到了攝政王的消息，他已經準備好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g8_airshipdock_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲的飛空艇已經升空，正在緩慢地向倫蒂尼姆方向轉向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的高速戰艦編隊已經在外圍做好了攔截準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也有其他部隊正在集結。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溫德米爾公爵的艦隊在更早之前就接近了這個地塊，開斯特公爵的軍艦也在蠢蠢欲動，恐怕很快也會接近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來大家都很關心這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真的關心嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是各位公爵來得有些太遲了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......那個酒店的大堂經理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼會在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是薩卡茲早就安插在倫蒂尼姆的間諜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，考伯特只是個普通的自認是個維多利亞人的薩卡茲清潔員罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_722_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼你呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_i06"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_i06"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"和朋友正聊到興頭上，卻被派出來幹活的可憐人罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"德拉克，你還真是掃興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛布拉娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，不如和我聊聊怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......饒了我們吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不如讓我們盡快結束這一切。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
